    # AGENTS.md — AI ExecutionKit v4 Project Authority
    
    Live repository/runtime truth wins. This file is the compact host router; detailed policy lives in executable CLI contracts and `STANDARD_V4.md`.
    
    <!-- EXECUTIONKIT_V4_BOOT_CONTRACT -->
    ## ExecutionKit v4 runtime boot contract
    
    At session start or a canonical task transition run:
    
    ~~~bash
    node .executionkit/runtime/kit/bin/executionkit-cli.mjs start . --host antigravity
    ~~~
    
