    <!-- /EXECUTIONKIT_V4_BOOT_CONTRACT -->
    
    ## Authority and systems
    
    `TODO.md` is the single canonical execution entrypoint/shard manifest; active shards own mutable task state. No shadow backlog, chat, generated report, issue board or memory may replace it. Memory is **ADVISORY_ONLY**.
    
    ExecutionKit v4 has **exactly ten executable systems**: Execution, Agent, State, Content, SEO, Docs, Audit, Test, Launch and Visual OS. Repository Intelligence, Database Integrity and Route Integrity are cross-cutting fabrics, not extra systems.
    
    ## Task hot path
    
    - Execution, Agent and State OS always participate.
    - Never fabricate evidence/results; never replace executable truth with Markdown.
    - No production mocks/stubs/placeholders. Implement real validation, errors, edge cases, accessibility and security boundaries.
